.TH UBUNTU_BOOT_TEST_RUN 1
.SH NAME
ubuntu_boot_test_run \- run automated bootloader tests
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ubuntu_boot_test_run
[\-h] {pcbios,uefi_noshim,uefi_shim} [\-h] \fB\-r\fR RELEASE \fB\-a\fR ARCH [packages ...]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
{pcbios,uefi_noshim,uefi_shim}
Test to run
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-r\fR RELEASE, \fB\-\-release\fR RELEASE
Guest Ubuntu release
.TP
\fB\-a\fR ARCH, \fB\-\-arch\fR ARCH
Guest architecture
.TP
packages
List of packages to install (does apt\-get download if empty)
